:: Setup [startup]
(set: $has_basket to false)(set: $apples to 0)

:: Gate {"position":"100,100","size":"100,100"}
The orchard gate creaks. Somewhere a ''bird'' calls.

(set: $apples to it + 1)
[[Go in->Trees]]
(if: $has_basket)[ [[Leave with the fruit->Home]] ]

:: Trees
Rows of trees heavy with //red// apples. You could [[pick up a basket->Shed]] first.

(if: $apples > 2)[You have plenty.]
[[Back to the gate->Gate]]

:: Shed
(set: $has_basket to true)
You find a basket.
[[Gate]]

:: Home
You walk home with the basket swinging.
